{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0171gfgUCcvPaXxYN643obdo","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Product events — registration funnel\n2\t\n3\tOwner: product. Status: approved, waiting for implementation.\n4\t\n5\tWe want to see where people drop out between opening the app and reading the\n6\toffers. Each row is one event. Names are snake_case and must match exactly,\n7\tdashboards and funnels are already built on them.\n8\t\n9\t| Event | When | Properties |\n10\t|---|---|---|\n11\t| `registration_email_started` | User started typing their email | — |\n12\t| `registration_phone_started` | User started typing their phone number | — |\n13\t| `loan_amount_changed` | User moved the loan amount slider | `amount` (int, the chosen amount) |\n14\t| `terms_accepted` | User ticked the terms and conditions checkbox | — |\n15\t| `registration_continue_tapped` | User tapped Continue on the registration screen | `amount` (int), `terms` (bool) |\n16\t| `offers_scrolled` | User scrolled the offers list | `offset` (double, how far they scrolled) |\n17\t\n18\tNotes\n19\t- Do not send the email or the phone number as properties (PII).\n20\t- Screen views are already tracked automatically, no event needed for those.\n21\t- The funnel is: email started → phone started → amount changed → terms\n22\t  accepted → continue tapped → offers scrolled.\n23\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b19e8168-4b26-42a6-9274-1c234c066419","uuid":"d5774186-d650-4ff9-9aab-d63638e6a05e","timestamp":"2026-10-27T04:21:13.589Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/tmp/h-EJLmfh/docs/EVENTS.md","content":"# Product events — registration funnel\n\nOwner: product. Status: approved, waiting for implementation.\n\nWe want to see where people drop out between opening the app and reading the\noffers. Each row is one event. Names are snake_case and must match exactly,\ndashboards and funnels are already built on them.\n\n| Event | When | Properties |\n|---|---|---|\n| `registration_email_started` | User started typing their email | — |\n| `registration_phone_started` | User started typing their phone number | — |\n| `loan_amount_changed` | User moved the loan amount slider | `amount` (int, the chosen amount) |\n| `terms_accepted` | User ticked the terms and conditions checkbox | — |\n| `registration_continue_tapped` | User tapped Continue on the registration screen | `amount` (int), `terms` (bool) |\n| `offers_scrolled` | User scrolled the offers list | `offset` (double, how far they scrolled) |\n\nNotes\n- Do not send the email or the phone number as properties (PII).\n- Screen views are already tracked automatically, no event needed for those.\n- The funnel is: email started → phone started → amount changed → terms\n  accepted → continue tapped → offers scrolled.\n","numLines":23,"startLine":1,"totalLines":23}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_0171gfgUCcvPaXxYN643obdo","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
