{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0149abTHm9Af2YwaLkGrCf6d","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# kredito\n2\t\n3\tFlutter app (iOS + Android) for a consumer loan broker. The user registers\n4\twith an email and a phone number, picks the amount they want to borrow, accepts\n5\tthe terms and gets a list of offers from partner banks. Two screens so far:\n6\t`lib/screens/registration_screen.dart` and `lib/screens/offer_screen.dart`.\n7\t\n8\tAnalytics is PostHog (`posthog_flutter`), set up in `lib/analytics.dart` and\n9\t`lib/main.dart`; screen views come from `PosthogObserver`. We are on the\n10\tPostHog free tier. Product events are defined in `docs/EVENTS.md`; the\n11\tscreens do not send any of them yet. Send events through `Analytics.capture`\n12\tso the key and host stay in one place.\n13\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b19e8168-4b26-42a6-9274-1c234c066419","uuid":"3bde05b6-0f62-4912-aa5c-8d9db133561a","timestamp":"2026-10-27T04:21:14.461Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/tmp/h-EJLmfh/README.md","content":"# kredito\n\nFlutter app (iOS + Android) for a consumer loan broker. The user registers\nwith an email and a phone number, picks the amount they want to borrow, accepts\nthe terms and gets a list of offers from partner banks. Two screens so far:\n`lib/screens/registration_screen.dart` and `lib/screens/offer_screen.dart`.\n\nAnalytics is PostHog (`posthog_flutter`), set up in `lib/analytics.dart` and\n`lib/main.dart`; screen views come from `PosthogObserver`. We are on the\nPostHog free tier. Product events are defined in `docs/EVENTS.md`; the\nscreens do not send any of them yet. Send events through `Analytics.capture`\nso the key and host stay in one place.\n","numLines":13,"startLine":1,"totalLines":13}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_0149abTHm9Af2YwaLkGrCf6d","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
